Bisney and Dixar is an animation studio in [[Geography/Los Diablos|Los Diablos]], on [[Geography/Earth|Earth]]. Its owners hold that audiences no longer want new stories, so it remakes its old ones. A goblin intern at the studio was given the run of a new [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]] and told to set it making films out of the studio's old material.
